OrderingViews::deadlockView - sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)

part near
  event occurrence sent
  event occurrence heard
part far
  event occurrence taken
  event occurrence spoke

messages:
  near.sent -> far.taken: ask of Tick
  far.taken -> far.spoke: answering
  far.spoke -> near.heard: reply of Tick
  near.heard -> near.sent

not represented:
  - successions form a cycle (answering, heard to sent); the messages are shown in declaration order
